      "act_id": "act1_blood_palace_taiyi_amnesty",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "narrator",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "text": "整座金碧辉煌、纤尘不染的【原初牧神天宫】，从每一块铺地白玉砖到每一根撑天蟠龙柱，底下浸泡的都是三千世界无数世代求道者不甘咽气的骨血！",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "vast_hall",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.28,
      "director_note": "旁白叙事（声场：vast_hall）"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c003_tai_yi_p006",
      "act_id": "act1_blood_palace_taiyi_amnesty",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "tai_yi",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "text": "[softly] 只要你点头，只需一念之间。",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "vast_hall",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.32,
      "director_note": "太一保持伸手姿态温和劝诱"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c004_nar_p007",
      "act_id": "act1_blood_palace_taiyi_amnesty",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "narrator",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "text": "白玉王座上的太一保持着伸手的姿态，纯白无瞳的眼眸静静注视着玉阶下的陆烬，声音平和得像是在劝说一个任性远游的孩子：",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "vast_hall",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.28,
      "director_note": "旁白叙事（声场：vast_hall）"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c005_tai_yi_p008",
      "act_id": "act1_blood_palace_taiyi_amnesty",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "tai_yi",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "text": "[calmly] 你不必再流血拼命，不必再去赌那连半成都没有的虚无胜算。你的父亲陆擎苍、你的故乡大苍北渊、还有你身边这位太上女帝，我都可以将他们划入仙庭特赦神域，赐予与世同存的无尽寿元。至于其余三千牧场的亿万生灵，继续在各自编织好的美梦里生老病死，岂非两全其美？",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "vast_hall",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.32,
      "director_note": "太一许诺将北渊亲故与姜清凰划入仙庭特赦神域"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c006_nar_p009",
      "act_id": "act1_blood_palace_taiyi_amnesty",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "narrator",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "text": "大殿内安静得落针可闻。姜清凰没有替陆烬开口半个字。她只是横剑立于陆烬左后方半步，清冷如霜的眸光坚定无比：无论眼前这个男人最终选择变回统御万古的太初始祖【墟】，还是拔刀向死，她姜清凰这把剑都陪他走到最后。在两道目光注视下，陆烬动了。",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "vast_hall",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.28,
      "director_note": "旁白叙事（声场：vast_hall）"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c007_sfx_steady_footsteps_jade_stairs",
      "act_id": "act1_blood_palace_taiyi_amnesty",
      "kind": "sfx",
      "role_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "text": "",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "dry",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "Slow steady resolute boot footsteps ascending echoing white marble palace stairs in dead silence",
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 1.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.25,
      "director_note": "陆烬踏着沉稳脚步走上通往天道母碑的九重白玉阶"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c008_nar_p012",
      "act_id": "act1_blood_palace_taiyi_amnesty",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "narrator",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "text": "他既没有去握太一伸出的那只白金神手，也没有后退半步，而是一步，又一步，踏着沉稳清脆的脚步声，缓步走上了通往【天道母碑】的九重白玉台阶。",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "vast_hall",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.65,
      "director_note": "旁白叙事（声场：vast_hall）"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c009_lu_jin_p013",
      "act_id": "act2_mortal_backbone_name_is_lujin",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "lu_jin",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "text": "[calmly] 太一，你刚才算了一亿三千万次胜率。",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "vast_hall",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.32,
      "director_note": "陆烬踏上九重白玉台阶停步开口"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c010_nar_p014",
      "act_id": "act2_mortal_backbone_name_is_lujin",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "narrator",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "text": "陆烬走到距离王座三十丈的平台中央停下脚步，右手轻轻摩挲着背上【断岳】刀柄那道三年前父亲留下的磕碰旧痕，平静开口道。",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "vast_hall",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.28,
      "director_note": "旁白叙事（声场：vast_hall）"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c011_lu_jin_p014",
      "act_id": "act2_mortal_backbone_name_is_lujin",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "lu_jin",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "text": "[coldly] 可有一笔账，你这颗只有算术没有心肝的脑子，算错了整整九个纪元。",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "vast_hall",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.32,
      "director_note": "陆烬摩挲断岳刀柄旧痕冷声斥太一算错九纪"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c012_nar_p015",
      "act_id": "act2_mortal_backbone_name_is_lujin",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "narrator",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "text": "太一眉头微不可察地蹙了一丝。",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "vast_hall",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
