    {
      "cue_id": "c013_tai_yi_p015",
      "act_id": "act2_mortal_backbone_name_is_lujin",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "tai_yi",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "text": "[coldly] 天道母碑穷尽宇宙因果，绝无错漏。",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 1.0,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "vast_hall",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.32,
      "director_note": "太一微蹙眉头笃定天算无漏"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c014_lu_jin_p016",
      "act_id": "act2_mortal_backbone_name_is_lujin",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "lu_jin",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "text": "[fiercely] 你错就错在，把活生生的人，当成了纸面上不会疼、不会恨、也不会拼命的数字！",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.0,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "vast_hall",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.32,
      "director_note": "陆烬字字如重锤砸向凌霄宝殿穹顶"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c015_nar_p017",
      "act_id": "act2_mortal_backbone_name_is_lujin",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "narrator",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "text": "陆烬抬起头，双眸之中暗金神光如烈火燃烧，声音不大，却字字如重锤般砸在整座凌霄宝殿的穹顶之上：",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "vast_hall",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.28,
      "director_note": "旁白叙事（声场：vast_hall）"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c016_lu_jin_p018",
      "act_id": "act2_mortal_backbone_name_is_lujin",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "lu_jin",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "text": "[coldly] [dramatically] 你说把众生锁死在黑屋子里当猪羊，他们便能糊涂安稳地活着？",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.0,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "vast_hall",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.32,
      "director_note": "陆烬双眸燃起暗金神光质问牧羊神"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c017_lu_jin_p019",
      "act_id": "act2_mortal_backbone_name_is_lujin",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "lu_jin",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "text": "[dramatically] 我在大苍北渊见过我的养父陆擎苍！他明明只要装聋作哑向血月低头，便能做享寿三百载的北渊第一紫府霸主。可他在千丈天渊石洞里，宁可不施麻沸散拿短刀活生生剖开自己的紫府挖出肉虫，哪怕修为尽废断去一臂，也要提刀爬出你画的死人皮鼓！",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.0,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "vast_hall",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.32,
      "director_note": "陆烬追忆养父陆擎苍天渊剖丹拒向血月低头"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c018_lu_jin_p020",
      "act_id": "act2_mortal_backbone_name_is_lujin",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "lu_jin",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "text": "[softly] [dramatically] 我在天渊谷底见过天生没有眼珠的盲眼少女阿盲！她们一族被你的无面仙使种下夺目恶咒世代清扫血渣，可当第一缕真正的星光透过裂开的血月洒在她脸上时，那个看不见光的小丫头摸着眼泪告诉我，外头的光是干干净净的！",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.0,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "vast_hall",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.32,
      "director_note": "陆烬追忆盲女阿盲仰望第一缕干净真星"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c019_lu_jin_p021",
      "act_id": "act2_mortal_backbone_name_is_lujin",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "lu_jin",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "text": "[dramatically] 我还在烬昼界见过四千年不曾摘下蒙眼黑布的守昼人，在归墟海狱见过宁可锁穿琵琶骨也不肯在脊梁上种半块外神仙骨的硬汉，在北渊西城老槐树下见过揣着一块旧木牌等到九十八岁闭眼的断臂老人！",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.0,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "vast_hall",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.32,
      "director_note": "陆烬历数守昼老人、归墟硬汉与老槐树下的福伯"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c020_nar_p022",
      "act_id": "act2_mortal_backbone_name_is_lujin",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "narrator",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "text": "[dramatically] 陆烬每说一句，便向前重重踏出一步！他身上没有半点太初古神居高临下的悲悯俯视，唯有一股从尸山血海与人间烟火里千锤百炼杀出来的滚烫锋芒！",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.0,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "vast_hall",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.28,
      "director_note": "旁白叙事（声场：vast_hall）"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c021_lu_jin_p024",
      "act_id": "act2_mortal_backbone_name_is_lujin",
      "kind": "dialogue",
